// Local.xcconfig.example — copy to Local.xcconfig (untracked, .gitignore) to sign a Release
// build with your own identity instead of the default ad hoc signing ("-"). project.yml's
// Release config includes this file only if it exists (`#include?`), so a fresh checkout
// builds and runs with no setup, and only whoever holds that identity can produce a build
// that carries it.
//
// CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
